From 517dcc91c757c9cb50b40eb3ea2801a832c2c4a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: scalpel4k <scalpel4k@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:03:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] LOCAL: media: iris: backport the driver from qcom-7.3 for
 Glymur

Take drivers/media/platform/qcom/iris unchanged from Qualcomm's qcom-7.3
branch (github.com/qualcomm-linux/kernel, at ee11c5b10, 2026-11-17). Mainline
7.3 has no Glymur platform data, so the qcom,glymur-iris node never probed.
This brings the Glymur/VPU3.6 platform (iris_platform_glymur.c), the reworked
VPU code, HFI gen2 updates and debugfs.

One adjustment: qcom-7.3 asks qcom_pas_get_backend() whether the SCM PAS
backend is active before calling qcom_scm_mem_protect_video_var(). That
helper does not exist in this tree and SCM is the only PAS backend here,
so the call is made unconditionally.
